> @simondanielsson #60084 is also open and is approved. Please check that and collaborate. Thanks!

@GodRishUniverse Thanks! IIUC that fix seems orthogonal to the changes here but indeed it's on the same topic

This PR doesn't try to convince triton that the k and v is indeed <2GiB. Instead it adds the option to specialize the kernel on >2GiB buffers during warmup instead of assuming it's always 32-bit addressable

